{"unit_id":"Lithane__dsh-account-balance#caveat-1","repo":"Lithane/dsh-account-balance","commit":"72ec9c4560d96d19f9c928487b0b22ba0d3ac163","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-account-balance 使用前须知：费用由本机 DSH 会话日志中的 token 用量估算，并非官方账单；读取压缩会话文件依赖 Node 内置 zstd，要求 Node ≥22.15。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:681-708","lib/index.js:732-780"]}
